---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Translate — Open Bible Stories" description="7 steps to translating Open Bible Stories into your language." active="translate">

<section class="page-header" style="padding-bottom:0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Help bring the Gospel to another language</p>
    <h1>How to translate Open Bible Stories</h1>
    <p>Help make the Gospel available in another language. Follow the steps below to start a new translation based on unfoldingWord&reg; Open Bible Stories.</p>

    <div class="page-tabs" role="tablist" style="margin-top:32px;">
      <button type="button" class="page-tab active" data-tab="howto" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="tab-panel-howto">How to Translate</button>
      <button type="button" class="page-tab" data-tab="resources" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tab-panel-resources">Resources</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div id="tab-panel-howto" role="tabpanel">
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="step-list">

      <div class="step-item">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Prepare</h3>
          <p>To prepare to translate, begin by installing <a href="https://scribe.bible/">Scribe SE</a>. For information on using Scribe SE, you may visit <a href="https://docs.scribe.bible/">the Scribe SE docs</a>.</p>
          <p>Access translation resources on the <a href="https://www.well.bible/">Bible Well app</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-item">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Understand</h3>
          <p>Study the <a href="https://app.notion.com/p/unfoldingword/Discover-the-Principles-of-Translation-using-OBS-bdb7947e460a4835a6b9c128b385407c?source=copy_link">foundational principles</a> you need for translation.</p>
          <p>Study "The Creation" in Scribe SE to become familiar with the story in the resource language.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-item">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Translate</h3>
          <p>In Scribe SE:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Open the Open Bible Story you want to translate</li>
            <li>Follow the steps on <a href="https://app.notion.com/p/unfoldingword/How-to-Draft-Internally-Check-OBS-7d87e72748f84d74b4fb834522b023f6">how to translate</a> with your team to complete the drafting process</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-item">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Check internally</h3>
          <p>Complete the steps for <a href="https://www.notion.so/unfoldingword/How-to-Draft-Internally-Check-OBS-7d87e72748f84d74b4fb834522b023f6">checking</a> to perform partner and team checks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-item">
        <div class="step-num">5</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Check externally</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Follow the steps on <a href="https://www.notion.so/unfoldingword/How-to-Externally-Check-OBS-b2d3de40fea54f158ae6cda5c3571790">this page</a> to perform external checks</li>
            <li>For more on checking, click <a href="https://checking.my.canva.site">here</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-item">
        <div class="step-num">6</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Publish</h3>
          <p>Once all stages of checking the translation have occurred, make final edits to the stories in Scribe SE and publish to <a href="https://door43.org">Door43</a>.</p>
          <p>Follow <a href="https://www.notion.so/unfoldingword/A-Checklist-to-Publish-54e0454cbc324fb5b3eaa389029308ea">this checklist</a> to determine that the stories are ready to publish.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-item">
        <div class="step-num">7</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Distribute</h3>
          <p>You can share your Open Bible Stories translation in a <a href="https://unfoldingword.notion.site/How-to-Distribute-Open-Bible-Stories-OBS-a3a74cc363e445bdb46190429c07cdb5">variety of formats</a> for evangelism and discipleship &mdash; or see the <a href="/create/">Create page</a> for the underlying source files.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-item celebrate">
        <div class="step-num">&#10003;</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Celebrate</h3>
          <p>Take time to rejoice that you have Open Bible Stories in your language. Share the good news with everyone and give praise to God for what He has done.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <p style="text-align:center; margin-top:32px; color:#4a5960; font-size:0.95rem;">
      Questions? Email <a href="mailto:info@unfoldingword.org" style="color:var(--inspire);">info@unfoldingword.org</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
</div>

<div id="tab-panel-resources" role="tabpanel" hidden>

<section style="padding-top:40px;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:32px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Equip others to understand and teach the Gospel</p>
      <h2>Resources</h2>
      <p>Translation Notes, Translation Questions, Study Notes, Study Questions, and the Extended (Theological Formation) edition &mdash; search your language once to see everything available for it. Looking for the stories themselves? That's <a href="/discover/" style="color:var(--inspire); font-weight:700;">Discover</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="res-browse">
      <div class="library-tools">
        <div class="search-box">
          <span aria-hidden="true">&#128269;</span>
          <input id="res-search" type="text" placeholder="Search by language name, e.g. Swahili">
        </div>
      </div>

      <p id="res-status" class="lib-status"></p>
      <div id="res-lang-list" class="lang-list"></div>
    </div>

    <div id="res-lang-detail" hidden style="max-width:720px; margin:0 auto;"></div>
  </div>
</section>

</div>

<section class="final-cta">
  <div class="wrap final-cta-inner">
    <h2>Need translation tools?</h2>
    <p>Scribe SE and other editors for starting a translation are listed on the Create page.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href="/create/" class="btn btn-primary">See translation tools</a>
      <a href="/discover/" class="btn btn-outline">Check what's already translated</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<Fragment slot="scripts">
<script is:inline src="/assets/js/resources.js"></script>
<script is:inline src="/assets/js/tabs.js"></script>
</Fragment>
</Base>
